    <tags>base64</tags>
    <summary>A base64 CLI tool with more features</summary>
    <releaseNotes>The init submission</releaseNotes>
    <description># gbase64
Encode/Decode data from FILE or standard input, to standard output.

## Usage
```shell
gbase64 [OPTION]... [FILE]
```
With no FILE, or when FILE is -, read standard input.

## Extra features
- `--url, -u`: encode/decode with URL format, defined in RFC 4648
- `--no-padding, -n`: encode with no-padding mode
    </description>
